<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1134045003">
<title>
DTC Confirmation Procedure
</title>
<attention1>
<ptxt>
If you do not select a suitable route and take proper precautions when performing a road test, an accident can occur.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Select a level road with no traffic to minimize the risk of accident.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the test extremely carefully.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform the road test using 2 persons, a driver and a tester.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention1>
<topic id = "AENLJA0A1134045004">
<title>
Changeover error
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drive vehicle for more than 10 cumulative hours at 10 km/h or higher vehicle speed.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(Engine can be turned on and off during this procedure.)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
While driving vehicle in step 1), depress brake pedal several times.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLJA0A1134045005">
<title>
Correlation error
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
When depressing or releasing brake pedal, check indication on “Brake Switch” in “Data List” mode on SUZUKI scan tool.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Run engine at idle speed.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Depress and release brake pedal 30 times.
</ptxt>
</s1>
</topic>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLJA0A1134045006">
<title>
DTC Troubleshooting
</title>
<diag type = "test" id = "AENLJA0A1134045007">
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134045008">
<question>
Was “Engine and Emission Control System Check” performed?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 2.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1134001">Engine and Emission Control System Check:K12D</intxref>
.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134045009">
<title>
Brake light switch power supply circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
When ignition is “OFF”, disconnect brake light switch connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check for proper terminal connection to brake light switch connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
If connections are OK, set ignition “ON”.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check that voltage between each of “A1” and “A2” circuits and ground is battery voltage.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 3.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Check “STOP” fuse or “IG1 SIG” fuse has not blown. If check result is OK, repair or replace defective wire harness.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134045010">
<title>
Brake light switch signal circuit check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
When ignition is “OFF”, disconnect “E01” connector from ECM.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check for proper terminal connection to “E01” connector.
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect rear combination light connector. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9206012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>
If connections are OK, check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance of “B1” and “B2” circuits: less than 1 &#937;
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between each of “B1” and “B2” circuits and ground: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “B1” circuit terminal and other terminal at brake light switch / brake switch connector: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Resistance between “B2” circuit terminal and other terminal at brake light switch / brake switch connector: infinity
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Voltage of “B1” and “B2” circuits: approx. 0 V (When ignition is “ON”)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Go to Step 4.
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Repair or replace defective wire harness.
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
<testgroup id = "AENLJA0A1134045011">
<title>
Brake light switch / brake switch check
</title>
<test1>
<ptxt>
Check brake light switch. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4106012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</test1>
<question>
Is check result OK?
</question>
<result type = "yes"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace ECM and recheck DTC. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A1336001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
<result type = "no"/>
<action>
<ptxt>
Replace brake light switch. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A4106011"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</action>
</testgroup>
</diag>
